{"title": "Mallikarjun Kharge Sworn in as Rajya Sabha Member After Re-Election", "summary": "Mallikarjun Kharge, the Congress chief, has been re-elected to the Rajya Sabha and taken oath as a member. This marks his return to the upper house of parliament after a gap. The development comes ahead of the upcoming general elections in India.", "summary_points": ["Mallikarjun Kharge has been re-elected to the Rajya Sabha from Karnataka.", "Kharge took oath as a Rajya Sabha member, marking his return to the upper house of parliament after a gap.", "The development comes ahead of the upcoming general elections in India.", "Kharge's re-election is seen as a boost for the Congress party ahead of the polls.", "The move also reflects the changing political landscape in Karnataka and its impact on national politics."], "title_hi": "कांग्रेस अध्यक्ष मल्लिकार्जुन खरगे ने राज्यसभा सदस्य के रूप में ली शपथ", "summary_hi": "कांग्रेस अध्यक्ष मल्लिकार्जुन खरगे ने राज्यसभा से वापसी के बाद फिर से राज्यसभा की सदस्यता ली है। यह उनके पिछले पद छोड़ने के बाद पहली बार है जब उन्होंने इस्तीफा देने के बजाय फिर से शपथ ली है।", "summary_points_hi": ["कांग्रेस अध्यक्ष मल्लिकार्जुन खरगे को राज्यसभा से वापसी के बाद फिर से राज्यसभा में चुना गया है।", "खरगे ने राज्यसभा की सदस्यता ली, जिससे उनकी पिछले पद छोड़ने के बाद पहली बार उन्होंने इस्तीफा देने के बजाय फिर से शपथ ली है।", "यह विकास आगामी सामान्य चुनावों के समय में महत्वपूर्ण हो सकता है।", "कांग्रेस पार्टी के लिए खरगे की फिर से राज्यसभा में शामिल होने से उनके लिए आगामी चुनावों में एक बड़ा फायदा हो सकता है।", "यह निर्णय राजस्थान और अन्य राज्यों की राजनीतिक परिस्थितियों को देखते हुए भारतीय राजनीति में महत्वपूर्ण बदलाव ला सकता है।"], "framing": {"left": ["ThePrint emphasizes the significance of Kharge's re-election for the Congress party ahead of the general elections. National Herald highlights the re-election as a personal achievement for Kharge."], "center": ["Mathrubhumi focuses on the fact that Kharge has returned to the Rajya Sabha after a gap, while also noting his re-election as a boost for the Congress party."], "right": ["Punjab Kesari frames the story around Kharge's return to the Rajya Sabha as a sign of the Congress party's resurgence."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["द थर्ट प्रिंट कांग्रेस अध्यक्ष मल्लिकार्जुन खरगे की राज्यसभा में फिर से शामिल होने को आगामी चुनावों के लिए महत्वपूर्ण बताता है।"], "center": ["मथुरभूमि खरगे की राज्यसभा में वापसी पर जोर देता है, साथ ही यह बताता है कि यह उनके लिए आगामी चुनावों में एक बड़ा फायदा हो सकता है।"], "right": ["पंजाब केसरी खरगे की राज्यसभा में वापसी को कांग्रेस पार्टी की पुनर्जन्म का संकेत देता है।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://img.punjabkesari.in/multimedia/914/0/0X0/0/static.punjabkesari.in/2026_6image_11_27_438020834kharge.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Cong councillor in Palakkad takes fresh oath"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Congress chief Kharge takes oath as Rajya Sabha member"}, {"source": "National Herald", "owner": "National Herald", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Kharge takes oath as Rajya Sabha member after re-election"}, {"source": "Mathrubhumi English", "owner": "Mathrubhumi English", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Re-elected from Karnataka, Mallikarjun Kharge takes oath as Rajya Sabha member"}, {"source": "Punjab Kesari", "owner": "Punjab Kesari", "lean": "right", "language": "hi", "url": "https://www.punjabkesari.in/national/news/congress-president-mallikarjun-kharge-took-the-oath-as-a-rajya-sabha-member-2351354", "headline": "कांग्रेस अध्यक्ष मल्लिकार्जुन खरगे ने राज्यसभा सदस्य के रूप में ली शपथ - congress president mallikarjun kharge took the oath as a rajya sabha member"